@12011 = ~*Pointing at the web shield* A remarkable shield you have there; but it seems dormant. I can awaken its full potential if you have the means to pay. I believe it would be worth 10,000 gold pieces.~
@12021 = ~*Noticing Kessek's Tooth* Hey, that is one of the famous Teeth of Kessek. And this one seems special. May I see it?~
@12022 = ~Here you are.~
@12023 = ~What makes you think I will get it back?~
@12024 = ~If I were to steal from you, Ribald would certainly no longer want me in his establishment. And I have no desire to sell my wares outside.~
@12025 = ~Your argument is sound. Here you go.~
@12026 = ~No, thank you.~
@12027 = ~All right, here you are.~
@12028 = ~Just as I suspected. This tooth possesses a will of its own. But it is being restrained, most likely because of its great distance from its original plane. If you wish, I can try to enchant it to simulate an energy that will remind it of its home plane. Not for free, of course. Let us say 15,000 gold pieces. Would that be acceptable?~
@12029 = ~Yes, do it.~
@120210 = ~No thank you, I have no gold to waste on that.~

@12031 = ~*Noticing the Bands of Concentration* Are those Bands of Concentration you have there? They certainly look like them.~
@12032 = ~Yes, how do you know?~
@12033 = ~These bracelets? No, I think you are mistaken.~
@12034 = ~All right, if you say so...~
@12035 = ~How do I know? You see, I have some myself. My brother gave them to me. He brings me many souvenirs from his travels. He even told me that mine were precious, that they once belonged to a master. If you want, I can sell them to you. But at a very high price, because if my brother finds out that I sold his souvenirs, he will never bring me anything again, so I am taking a risk. But I could convince him if I showed him a substantial pile of coins. Therefore, I would ask for...... 50,000 gold pieces.~
@12036 = ~Are you out of your mind? 50,000 gold pieces for something whose true value I am not even certain of? Absolutely not.~
@12037 = ~Fine, here is your gold. I can afford it.~
@12038 = ~Then here they are. Do not damage them, they are precious.~

@12039 = ~*Noticing and pointing at the Mageblade Ring* Hey, that's mine!~
@12040 = ~What are you saying? Can you prove it?~
@12041 = ~Get your filthy hands away from there, peasant!~
@12042 = ~Uh... no. Well, uh... did you know that this ring has a special ability?~
@12043 = ~A special ability? Like a Charge ability? No, it does not. You are mistaken, therefore you are not the owner of this ring.~
@12044 = ~Ah, but it does have one. You simply do not know how to reveal it... I do! But since I am in no position to demand this family heirloom from you, I can reveal the secret for 500 gold pieces.~
@12045 = ~*Give 500 gold pieces* This jewel belonged to your family? Very well, reveal this special ability and I will know it is yours. I will return it to you. But you had better not be lying to me...~
@12046 = ~500 gold pieces for some supposed ability that I never noticed? Get out of my sight!~
@12047 = ~500 gold pieces? Very well, I am interested. Here you are.~~500 gold pieces? Very well, I am interested. Here you are.~
@12048 = ~It is very simple. *He takes your hands, manipulates the ring and moves it.* You simply need to wear the ring on your OTHER hand, on THIS finger, and upside down. And there you go, it works.~
@12049 = ~Very well, you told the truth. As agreed, here is your ring.~
@12050 = ~Very well, you told the truth. As agreed, here is your ring. Now, if you truly wanted to be honest, you would return 499 gold pieces to me.~
@12051 = ~Very well, it worked. Thank you, peon.~
@12052 = ~Very well. Now return my 500 gold pieces or I will gut you.~
@12053 = ~Ho ho....~

@12054 = ~Good day, ladies and gentlemen. Allow me to introduce myself: Maxime Fistenbul. I represent my master Gerold Adelpendim, the Third of His Name. The man you knew as "Quallo". Thanks to you, my master was able to recover his name, his family, and his domain. I have therefore come in his name to present you with a reward and a small special gift....~
@12055 = ~There you are. Please make good use of your ring's new abilities. Farewell, ladies and gentlemen.~
@12056 = ~Maxime the Butler~